	(text "DESIGN INTENT (this sheet):\n- AVDD = AFE_3V0, DVDD = DVDD_F (2.7-3.6 V internal-LDO mode), CAP = 220 nF, single GND (AGND/DGND joined).\n- CLKIN only from X1 (YXC OT2JI-111-8.192M, C7425393) via R6001 33 ohm source series. No clock from the XIAO.\n- R6002 33 ohm at DOUT (MISO source term), R6003 100 ohm at DRDY (GPIO2 boot-glitch contention limit)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 256.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "652d88c0-7688-5d9c-9206-fae8170e8354")
	)
	(text "ADC - ADS131M04 (TSSOP-20), AIN mapping CH1->AIN0, CH2->AIN1, CH3->AIN2, CH4->AIN3 (as Rev A copper)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7bb597e0-233e-5d08-9547-4573b6841140")
	)
	(text "Probe policy: no test pads on SPI, CLKIN or AIN nets - probe at R6001/R6002/R6003 pads or XIAO castellations."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 162.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cd0b4d1d-f5ca-5aaa-b1c5-5685043edce2")
	)
	(text "X1 pin 1 (OE) tied to DVDD_F (never floating) per RB-00.5 R4. X1 pin 4 VDD with C6010 100 nF.\nClock net ADC_CLKIN: X1 -> R6001 -> U6001 pin 17 only (<= 6 mm, no test stub)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 88.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f6c379c6-0b02-5382-954e-fb14a4a24f24")
	)
